+ *   <li><b>Route (i) — fresh-classloader bootstrap</b> for a DIFFERENT ClassLoader B (cache miss).</li>
+ *   <li><b>Route (ii) — cache HIT</b> for a ClassLoader C whose providers were resolved and cached
