+ *       {@code ServiceLoader} at all.</li>
+ *   <li><b>Route (iii) — cache invalidation</b> via the reflectively-invoked
+ *       {@code Validation.clearDefaultValidationProviderResolverCache()} (→ {@code clearCache()} L342).</li>
+ * </ol>
